{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-beta04","title":"Buture Beta04 Heavy Duty Car Jump Starter 6000A丨27000mAh Battery, 65W Two-Way Fast Charge","description":"\u003cp\u003eImagine driving through the remote stretches of the Arizona desert when your car battery suddenly dies, leaving you miles away from the nearest help. In this situation, having the Buture Beta04 Portable Car Jump Starter in your trunk can make all the difference. This compact device can jump-start your car quickly, ensuring you’re not stranded for long.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat Cars Beta04 Portable Car Jump Starter Supports?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for jump-starting flat car batteries, Buture portable Beta04 supports a wide range of vehicles, including:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLawn Mowers: Up to 1.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMotorcycles: Up to 3.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCars and SUVs: Up to 6.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrucks: Up to 9.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeavy-Duty Trucks: Up to 12.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith an impressive 99% success rate and virtually zero errors, this top-rated portable car jump starter from the Buture Store delivers reliable performance for a variety of engine sizes and types.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBesides, another reason you may want to choose the Buture Beta04 Portable Car Jump Starter is that it operates reliably in temperatures ranging from -20℃ to 60℃ (-4℉ to 140℉), ensuring your vehicle can be jump-started year-round, regardless of weather conditions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHow to Start Your Car\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eStep-by-Step Instructions\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003col style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnect Cables: Red clamp to positive (+), black clamp to negative (-).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCheck Indicator: Wait for the indicator sign on the screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStart Engine: Start your car.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eUsing the Force Start Function\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Force Start Function is necessary when the screen doesn’t display anything after connecting the clamps. This situation can occur if the car battery is completely dead or if there is a false short circuit alarm, preventing the automatic detection system from recognizing a proper connection. The Force Start Function overrides this issue by providing a direct boost of power to the battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePress Button: Hold the force start button for 5 seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCheck Screen: Ensure the two signs appear on the screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStart Engine: Start your car.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning: \u003c\/strong\u003eWhen using the Force Start Function, auto-detection and safety features will be disabled. This means the device will not automatically detect issues like reverse polarity or short circuits, so extra caution is required.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eThe Safety Features During Starting Your Car\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eBuilt-In Protections\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReverse connection protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOverheat protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow voltage protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShort circuit protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAdditional Safety Features\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTimeout protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow and high-temperature protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eUser-Friendly Warnings\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta04 Portable Car Jump Starter features a comprehensive 3.3-inch smart display that provides clear and intuitive indicators to help you troubleshoot any issues during the jump-start process.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBeta04 Car Jump Starter Highly Recommended Portable Design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eMulti-Functionality:\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower Bank:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a 27000mAh Li-on battery to readily charge multiple devices, including phones, MacBooks, and laptops.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures 65W USB-C, 160W DC out, and 2x18W USB ports for versatile charging options.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmergency Lighting:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4 modes lights for different emergencies and can double as a warning triangle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdated 600 lumens LED lights with a larger luminous area and 300° wide-angle irradiation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProvides 400%+ brightness and can be used continuously for 96 hours, outperforming counterparts and enhancing safety.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eCompact Size:\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 9 x 3.5 x 1.5 inches.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasily fits in your trunk or glove compartment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeighs just 2.5 pounds, making it easy to carry and handle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eDurability:\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComes with a sturdy case that holds the jump starter and accessories.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRobust design protects against drops, dust, and rain, ensuring longevity and reliable performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing a Portable Car Jump Starter offers numerous advantages. It provides convenience and independence by eliminating the need for another vehicle or roadside assistance, allowing for quick and easy use. Its versatility enables it to jump-start various vehicles and charge electronic devices. Essential for emergency preparedness, especially in remote areas or during long trips, it ensures you are always ready for unexpected situations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure Beta04 Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .beta04-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .beta04-table th, .beta04-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .beta04-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .beta04-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"beta04-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePeak Current (A)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e6000\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (mAh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e27000\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (Wh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e99.9\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompatible Vehicle Types\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAll Gas\/12.0L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Dimensions (inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.1 x 3.9 x 10.4\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e0.950 kg\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOperating Temperature Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e-4℉~140℉\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB-C: 65W Max\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB 1\/2: 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003cbr\u003eDC: 12-16V\/10A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSupports DC\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (160W MAX with DC)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLight Modes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4 modes: 600 Lumens Lighting\/Strobe\/Orange Strobe\/SOS\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eForced Start\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (product)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDisplay Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (3.3\" color)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAccessories\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eEC6 Clamps x1\u003cbr\u003eUSB C to USB C Cable x1\u003cbr\u003eUSB to USB C Cable x1\u003cbr\u003eDC Adapter x1\u003cbr\u003eEVA Case x1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492418838783,"sku":"Beta04","price":109.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-beta04-car-jump-starter.webp?v=1748245233","url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/products\/buture-jump-starter-beta04","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}